em/verapamilo si quimioterapia CYP3A4 (inhibe metabolismo)","guid":"UPQPVNrhSH2v2eq_WvaJ-Q","children":[]}]},{"id":"155","parent":"0","text":"Tromboembolismo asociado cáncer","guid":"SCHswCd7TsWJkcnE2EykcQ","children":[{"id":"156","parent":"155","text":"Khorana score predice riesgo TEV","guid":"rRkRvbuzSRSgPZ_rMC-dkg","children":[]},{"id":"157","parent":"155","text":"Profilaxis ambulatoria si Khorana ≥2 con apixaban o rivaroxaban","guid":"p_8ES7pzRGeyg2MJrFai4g","children":[]},{"id":"158","parent":"155","text":"HBPM o ACOD (apixaban, rivaroxaban, edoxaban) en TEV agudo","guid":"tGJZETtjTp2_F3RAF8glhA","children":[]},{"id":"159","parent":"155","text":"HOKUSAI VTE Cancer, SELECT-D, CARAVAGGIO: ACOD no inferior a HBPM","guid":"ODrZ6zLHQnGdPOKKnIBY2Q","children":[]},{"id":"160","parent":"155","text":"Excepción: cáncer GI o GU sangrante → preferir HBPM","guid":"0xwEGoMVTLWszMCE6ih08Q","children":[]}]},{"id":"161","parent":"0","text":"Pericarditis y derrame","guid":"kM8hUBzgQIWMA1xcEeIrlQ","children":[{"id":"162","parent":"161","text":"Radioterapia mediastínica","guid":"2gv8iaOCSk24pOvgP6SinQ","children":[]},{"id":"163","parent":"161","text":"Algunos quimioterápicos (ciclofosfamida altas dosis)","guid":"0c0cBD4uQB-i15W4dDuIwA","children":[]},{"id":"164","parent":"161","text":"Manejo según estándar (AINEs, colchicina, corticoides si autoinmune)","guid":"FETAAIamT0mBJt_9hKbp7A","children":[]}]},{"id":"165","parent":"0","text":"Geriatría — particularidades","guid":"TPeVp4npR6C1fSsPWjuVTw","children":[{"id":"166","parent":"165","text":"AM con cáncer + cardiopatía → balance complejo","guid":"G8shVotcTO--7jasRt0UKg","children":[]},{"id":"167","parent":"165","text":"Reserva cardíaca disminuida → ↑ vulnerabilidad cardiotoxicidad","guid":"0HEDVfgXQxm1oyrL7YlGzg","children":[]},{"id":"168","parent":"165","text":"Polifarmacia → interacciones múltiples","guid":"DSuEBpVlQOSwTuPyPdeS6w","children":[]},{"id":"169","parent":"165","text":"Comorbilidad ERC, anemia, fragilidad","guid":"O19P